     "explanation": "Her expertise is technical capability, not legal position — she describes what exists, in what form, at what cost, and counsel builds the objection or the offer. Choosing the PDF unilaterally is the tempting wrong answer: Rule 34 lets the requester specify a form, and substituting a different one without objecting or conferring risks a motion to compel and a second production at your expense.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">WHO DECIDES WHAT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">The professional boundary in a format dispute</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"145\" width=\"440\" height=\"400\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">HIM SAYS</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;This view is not a file.&#8221;</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;We can extract 41 fields.&#8221;</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"350\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;That takes 30 vendor hours.&#8221;</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"400\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;It cannot be redacted.&#8221;</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"450\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;Screenshots are possible.&#8221;</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"505\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Facts about the system</text><rect x=\"605\" y=\"145\" width=\"440\" height=\"400\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"825\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">COUNSEL SAYS</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"250\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;We object to form.&#8221;</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;We offer this instead.&#8221;</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"350\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;That is proportional.&#8221;</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"400\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;This is privileged.&#8221;</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"450\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8220;We will meet and confer.&#8221;</text><text x=\"640\" y=\"505\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Positions about the law</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"585\" width=\"990\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"635\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE TWO WAYS THIS GOES WRONG</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"685\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8226; HIM quietly substitutes a different form than the one requested</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"730\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">&#8226; Counsel promises a form nobody checked the system can produce</text><rect x=\"55\" y=\"790\" width=\"990\" height=\"245\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE FIX: ONE CONVERSATION, EARLY</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"890\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">Before counsel answers the request, walk them through</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"930\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"21\">every available export, its fidelity, its cost, its limits.</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"985\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">A format promise made without HIM in the room becomes</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"1018\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">a court order you cannot comply with.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "HIM supplies technical facts; counsel takes legal positions. Trouble starts when either crosses the line."
     }
